test('AT-N14 実完全保存を端末内正本も履歴もない空 context に持ち込み、本文・ID・条件・素材を保って編集を再開する', async ({ page, browser, baseURL }, info) => {
  const p = createProject('AT-N14 外部完全保存から復帰');
  const scene = createEntity(p.projectId, 'scene', '復旧する本文', { body: textToRichText('失う前の本文😀') });
  const variable = createEntity(p.projectId, 'variable', '復旧する状態', { key: 'recovered', valueType: 'boolean', scope: 'run', initial: { type: 'boolean', value: true } });
  const entry = createEntity(p.projectId, 'flow_node', '復旧する入口', { nodeType: 'entry', sceneId: scene.id });
  const end = createEntity(p.projectId, 'flow_node', '復旧する終端', { nodeType: 'terminal', terminalReason: '条件も復旧した' });
  const edge = createEntity(p.projectId, 'flow_edge', '復旧する条件', { fromId: entry.id, toId: end.id, label: '復旧条件で進む', condition: { op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'eq', value: { type: 'boolean', value: true } } });
  const prepared = await prepareAsset(new Uint8Array(await readFile('tests/fixtures/media/fixture-tone.wav')), '復旧する実音声.wav');
  const { bytes: assetBytes, preview: _preview, ...metadata } = prepared;
  const asset = createEntity(p.projectId, 'attachment', '復旧する実音声', metadata);
  p.entities.push(scene, variable, entry, end, edge, asset);
  const fixture = await exportScenario(p, { loadAsset: hash => hash === prepared.contentHash ? assetBytes : undefined });
  await attachGiven(info, 'AT-N14', fixture, { projectId: p.projectId, entityIds: p.entities.map(entity => entity.id), blockId: scene.data.body[0].id, condition: edge.data.condition, assetHash: prepared.contentHash, realAssetFixture: 'tests/fixtures/media/fixture-tone.wav' });
  await seed(page, fixture);
  await openEntity(page, 'scene', scene.name);
  await editBody(page, '外部ファイルへ保存した本文😀');
  const external = await backup(page);
  const givenIds = new Set(p.entities.map(entity => entity.id));
  expect(external.project.entities.filter(entity => givenIds.has(entity.id))
    .map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
    .toEqual(p.entities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
  const firstReviews = external.project.entities.filter(entity => !givenIds.has(entity.id));
  expect(firstReviews).toHaveLength(1);
  const firstReview = firstReviews[0];
  if (!firstReview || firstReview.kind !== 'review') throw new Error('最初の本文保存が変更確認以外の情報を追加しました');
  expect(firstReview).toMatchObject({ status: 'needs_review', visibility: 'private',
    data: { target: entry.id, targetVersionId: p.projectId, stage: 'open' } });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(firstReview.customValues['changeReview.sourceRevisions']))).toEqual({ [scene.id]: '1' });
  expect(firstReview.data.body.map(block => block.text).join('\n')).toContain(`(${scene.id})。改訂 0 → 1。`);
  expect(external.project.history.length).toBeGreaterThan(0);
  expect(external.assets).toHaveLength(1);
  expect(external.assets[0].bytes).toEqual(assetBytes);
  await info.attach('AT-N14-external-backup.scenario', { body: Buffer.from(external.bytes), contentType: 'application/zip' });
  await expect(page.locator('.backup-page')).toContainText('端末のダウンロードを確認してください');

  // given: no source database, local history, cookie or localStorage is copied.
  // This is declared browser storage-loss isolation, not physical-device loss.
  const emptyContext = await browser.newContext({ baseURL });
  try {
    const restoredPage = await emptyContext.newPage();
    await restoredPage.goto('./');
    await expect(restoredPage.getByRole('button', { name: '保存ファイルを読み込む', exact: true })).toBeVisible();
    expect(JSON.parse(await authorFingerprint(restoredPage))).toEqual([[], [], [], [], [], []]);

const emptyContext = await browser.newContext({ baseURL });
try {
  const restoredPage = await emptyContext.newPage();
  await restoredPage.goto('./');
  await expect(restoredPage.getByRole('button', { name: '保存ファイルを読み込む', exact: true })).toBeVisible();
  expect(JSON.parse(await authorFingerprint(restoredPage))).toEqual([[], [], [], [], [], []]);
  // when: only the actual downloaded .scenario is imported via normal UI.
  await seed(restoredPage, external.bytes);
  const imported = await backup(restoredPage);
  expect(imported.project.projectId).toBe(external.project.projectId);
  expect(imported.project.entities).toEqual(external.project.entities);
  expect(imported.project.history).toEqual(external.project.history);
  expect(imported.project.snapshots).toEqual(external.project.snapshots);
  expect(imported.assets).toEqual(external.assets);

await openEntity(restoredPage, 'scene', scene.name);
const bodyTab = restoredPage.locator('.detail-panel').getByRole('tab', { name: '本文', exact: true });
if (await bodyTab.isVisible()) await bodyTab.click();
await expect(restoredPage.locator('.detail-panel').getByRole('textbox', { name: '本文', exact: true })).toHaveValue('外部ファイルへ保存した本文😀');
await editBody(restoredPage, '空環境で編集を再開した本文😀');
// The first scene save already created one dependency review. Resuming
// author editing creates exactly one more, before the cold reread.
const resumed = await backup(restoredPage);
const externalIds = new Set(external.project.entities.map(entity => entity.id));
expect(external.project.entities).toHaveLength(7);
expect(resumed.project.entities.filter(entity => externalIds.has(entity.id))
  .map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual(external.project.entities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
expect(resumed.project.entities.filter(entity => externalIds.has(entity.id) && entity.id !== scene.id))
  .toEqual(external.project.entities.filter(entity => entity.id !== scene.id));
const resumedScene = resumed.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === scene.id);
if (!resumedScene || resumedScene.kind !== 'scene') throw new Error('再編集した本文がありません');
expect(resumedScene.revision).toBe('2');
expect(resumedScene.data).toEqual({ ...scene.data, body: [{ ...scene.data.body[0], text: '空環境で編集を再開した本文😀' }] });
const resumedReviews = resumed.project.entities.filter(entity => !externalIds.has(entity.id));
expect(resumedReviews).toHaveLength(1);
const review = resumedReviews[0];
if (!review || review.kind !== 'review') throw new Error('本文の再編集が変更確認以外の情報を追加しました');
expect(review).toMatchObject({ projectId: p.projectId, status: 'needs_review', visibility: 'private',
  data: { target: entry.id, targetVersionId: p.projectId, stage: 'open', quotedText: null, resolution: [] },
  customValues: { 'changeReview.generatedBy': 'semantic-change-review/v1', 'changeReview.projectRevision': '2' } });
expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.sourceIds']))).toEqual([scene.id]);
expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.sourceRevisions']))).toEqual({ [scene.id]: '2' });
expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.paths'])))
  .toEqual({ [scene.id]: { directPaths: ['data.sceneId'], relationLabels: [] } });
expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.key'])))
  .toEqual({ targetId: entry.id, sources: [{ id: scene.id, revision: '2', directPaths: ['data.sceneId'], relationLabels: [] }] });
expect(review.data.body.map(block => block.text).join('\n')).toContain(`(${scene.id})。改訂 1 → 2。`);
expect(resumed.project.entities).toHaveLength(8);
expect(resumed.assets).toEqual(external.assets);
expect(resumed.project.history.slice(0, imported.project.history.length)).toEqual(imported.project.history);
expect(resumed.project.history).toHaveLength(imported.project.history.length + 1);
expect(resumed.project.snapshots).toEqual(imported.project.snapshots);
const resumedFingerprint = await authorFingerprint(restoredPage);
await restoredPage.reload();
expect(await authorFingerprint(restoredPage)).toBe(resumedFingerprint);
const cold = await backup(restoredPage), actual = cold.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === scene.id);
if (!actual || actual.kind !== 'scene') throw new Error('復旧後の本文がありません');
expect(actual.data.body[0]).toEqual({ ...scene.data.body[0], text: '空環境で編集を再開した本文😀' });
expect(cold.project.entities.map(entity => entity.id).sort()).toEqual(resumed.project.entities.map(entity => entity.id).sort());
expect(cold.project.entities).toEqual(resumed.project.entities);
expect(cold.project.history).toEqual(resumed.project.history);
expect(cold.project.snapshots).toEqual(resumed.project.snapshots);
expect(cold.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === edge.id)?.data).toEqual(edge.data);
expect(cold.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === variable.id)?.data).toEqual(variable.data);
expect(cold.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === asset.id)?.data).toEqual(asset.data);
expect(cold.assets).toEqual(resumed.assets);

expect(external.project.history.length).toBeGreaterThan(0);
expect(external.assets).toHaveLength(1);
expect(external.assets[0].bytes).toEqual(assetBytes);
await info.attach('AT-N14-external-backup.scenario', { body: Buffer.from(external.bytes), contentType: 'application/zip' });
await expect(page.locator('.backup-page')).toContainText('端末のダウンロードを確認してください');

// given: no source database, local history, cookie or localStorage is copied.
// This is declared browser storage-loss isolation, not physical-device loss.
const emptyContext = await browser.newContext({ baseURL });
try {
  const restoredPage = await emptyContext.newPage();
  await restoredPage.goto('./');
  await expect(restoredPage.getByRole('button', { name: '保存ファイルを読み込む', exact: true })).toBeVisible();
  expect(JSON.parse(await authorFingerprint(restoredPage))).toEqual([[], [], [], [], [], []]);
  // when: only the actual downloaded .scenario is imported via normal UI.
  await seed(restoredPage, external.bytes);
  const imported = await backup(restoredPage);
  expect(imported.project.projectId).toBe(external.project.projectId);
  expect(imported.project.entities).toEqual(external.project.entities);
  expect(imported.project.history).toEqual(external.project.history);
  expect(imported.project.snapshots).toEqual(external.project.snapshots);
  expect(imported.assets).toEqual(external.assets);

// negative_or_edge: the recovery source is a downloaded file, not history
// in the lost context. Separate-device/off-device retention remains blocked.
await attachObservation(info, 'AT-N14-observation', { initialDurableRows: [[], [], [], [], [], []], externalFileSha256: sha256(external.bytes), resumedFileSha256: sha256(resumed.bytes), coldFileSha256: sha256(cold.bytes), coldRevision: cold.project.revision, originalGivenIds: p.entities.map(entity => entity.id).sort(), importedExternalIds: [...externalIds].sort(), resumedBaselineIds: resumed.project.entities.map(entity => entity.id).sort(), resumedReview: review, fullResumedBaselineEntities: resumed.project.entities, canonicalColdUnchanged: true, preservedEntityIds: cold.project.entities.map(entity => entity.id), preservedBlockId: actual.data.body[0].id, preservedAssetSha256: sha256(cold.assets[0].bytes), sourceWasDownloadedFile: true, physicalDeviceLossObserved: false, separateDeviceFileRetention: 'blocked_external_condition' });

test('AT-N16 同じ条件 ID を構造化画面と JSON で編集し、純粋評価の真偽不明・実エラーコードと試読表示を比較する', async ({ page }, info) => {
  const p = createProject('AT-N16 条件の共通規則');
  const variable = createEntity(p.projectId, 'variable', '共通の整数', { key: 'common_count', valueType: 'integer', scope: 'run', initial: { type: 'integer', value: 2 }, allowed: {} });
  const contract = createEntity(p.projectId, 'external_contract', '宣言した整数の外部値', { key: 'external_count', owner: 'game', inputType: 'integer', outputType: 'integer', missingPolicy: 'unknown' });
  const scene = createEntity(p.projectId, 'scene', '共通規則の本文', { body: textToRichText('構造化表示と JSON 表示は同じ条件を編集する。') });
  const entry = createEntity(p.projectId, 'flow_node', '共通規則の入口', { nodeType: 'entry', sceneId: scene.id });
  const end = createEntity(p.projectId, 'flow_node', '共通規則の終端', { nodeType: 'terminal', terminalReason: '条件を確認した' });
  const initial: Condition = { op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'eq', value: { type: 'integer', value: 0 } };
  const edge = createEntity(p.projectId, 'flow_edge', '同じ条件を編集する線', { fromId: entry.id, toId: end.id, label: '共通規則で進む', condition: initial });
  p.entities.push(variable, contract, scene, entry, end, edge);
  p.entities.forEach(entity => { entity.status = 'confirmed'; });
  const bytes = await exportScenario(p);
  await attachGiven(info, 'AT-N16', bytes, { projectId: p.projectId, entityIds: p.entities.map(entity => entity.id), edgeId: edge.id, variableId: variable.id, contractId: contract.id, initialCondition: initial, evaluator: 'src/domain/conditions.ts:evaluateCondition', displays: ['structured condition editor', 'full data JSON editor', 'trial reader'] });
  await seed(page, bytes);

  // given/when: the first edit uses the real structured condition controls.
  await openEntity(page, 'flow_edge', edge.name);
  const field = page.locator('.detail-panel [data-field="condition"]');
  await field.getByLabel('比較演算', { exact: true }).selectOption('ge');
  await field.getByLabel('値', { exact: true }).fill('3');
  await page.locator('.editor-footer').getByRole('button', { name: '保存する', exact: true }).click();
  await expect(page.locator('.editor-save-state')).toContainText('端末内保存済み');
  const structured = await backup(page), structuredEdge = structured.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === edge.id);
  if (!structuredEdge || structuredEdge.kind !== 'flow_edge') throw new Error('構造化画面で保存した条件がありません');
  expect(structuredEdge.data.condition).toEqual({ op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'ge', value: { type: 'integer', value: 3 } });
  const falseResult = evaluate(structured.project, structuredEdge.data.condition!);
  expect(falseResult.value).toBe('false');
  await reader(page, entry.id);
  const choice = page.locator('.reader-choice').filter({ hasText: '共通規則で進む' });
  await expect(choice).toBeDisabled();
  await expect(choice).toContainText('条件を満たしていません');

  // The same durable record/reference IDs are then edited through JSON.
  const trueCondition: Condition = { ...structuredEdge.data.condition!, op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'ge', value: { type: 'integer', value: 2 } };
  await openEntity(page, 'flow_edge', edge.name);
  await editData(page, { ...structuredEdge.data, condition: trueCondition });
  const json = await backup(page), jsonEdge = json.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === edge.id);
  if (!jsonEdge || jsonEdge.kind !== 'flow_edge') throw new Error('JSON 画面で保存した条件がありません');

// Normal author saves of initial=unknown and its restoration create exactly
// two dependency reviews. They precede the stub and retain all six given IDs.
const givenIds = new Set(p.entities.map(entity => entity.id));
const retainedGiven = external.project.entities.filter(entity => givenIds.has(entity.id));
expect(retainedGiven.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual(p.entities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
const generatedReviews = external.project.entities.filter(entity => !givenIds.has(entity.id));
expect(generatedReviews).toHaveLength(2);
const transitions = generatedReviews.map(review => {
  if (review.kind !== 'review') throw new Error('通常保存が変更確認以外の情報を追加しました');
  const sourceRevisions = JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.sourceRevisions'])) as Record<string, string>;
  const next = sourceRevisions[variable.id];
  expect(['1', '2']).toContain(next);
  expect(review).toMatchObject({ projectId: p.projectId, status: 'needs_review', visibility: 'private',
    data: { target: edge.id, targetVersionId: p.projectId, stage: 'open', quotedText: null, resolution: [] },
    customValues: { 'changeReview.generatedBy': 'semantic-change-review/v1',
      'changeReview.projectRevision': next === '1' ? '3' : '4' } });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.sourceIds']))).toEqual([variable.id]);
  expect(sourceRevisions).toEqual({ [variable.id]: next });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.paths'])))
    .toEqual({ [variable.id]: { directPaths: ['data.condition.variableId'], relationLabels: [] } });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.key'])))
    .toEqual({ targetId: edge.id, sources: [{ id: variable.id, revision: next,
      directPaths: ['data.condition.variableId'], relationLabels: [] }] });
  expect(review.data.body.map(block => block.text).join('\n'))
    .toContain(`(${variable.id})。改訂 ${next === '1' ? '0' : '1'} → ${next}。`);
  return next;
});
expect(transitions.sort()).toEqual(['1', '2']);
const baselineEntities = external.project.entities;
const baselineIds = baselineEntities.map(entity => entity.id).sort();
expect(baselineIds).toHaveLength(8);

// An unknown declared value remains unknown in both the oracle and UI.
await openEntity(page, 'variable', variable.name);
await editData(page, { ...variable.data, initial: { type: 'unknown', value: null, reason: 'AT-N16 未調査' } });
const unknown = await backup(page);
const unknownResult = evaluate(unknown.project, trueCondition);
expect(unknownResult).toEqual({ value: 'unknown', reasons: ['AT-N16 未調査'] });
await reader(page, entry.id);
await expect(choice).toBeDisabled();
await expect(choice).toContainText('未確認');
for (const reason of unknownResult.reasons) await expect(choice).toContainText(reason);
await openEntity(page, 'variable', variable.name);
await editData(page, variable.data);

// A valid AST with a mismatched typed comparison has the evaluator's code.

await openEntity(page, 'flow_edge', edge.name);
await editData(page, { ...externalEdge.data, condition: externalCondition });
const input: Record<string, TypedValue> = { [contract.id]: { type: 'integer', value: 1 } };
const externalIssue = failure(external.project, externalCondition, input);
await reader(page, entry.id);
await expect(choice).toContainText('未確認');
const beforeStub = await authorFingerprint(page);
const nativeStoredRecords = (JSON.parse(beforeStub)[1] as { projectId: string; record: { id: string; kind: string } }[])
  .filter(row => row.projectId === p.projectId).map(row => row.record);
// Native rich text is stored as block-ID markers, not hydrated Entity data.
expect(nativeStoredRecords.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual(baselineEntities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
await page.locator('.runtime-external .runtime-variable').filter({ hasText: contract.name }).getByRole('button', { name: '仮値', exact: true }).click();
const dialog = page.getByRole('dialog', { name: '作者の仮値を設定', exact: true });
await dialog.getByLabel('値の型', { exact: true }).selectOption('integer');
await dialog.getByLabel('値', { exact: true }).fill('1');
await dialog.getByRole('button', { name: '仮値を適用', exact: true }).click();

await field.getByLabel('値', { exact: true }).fill('3');
await page.locator('.editor-footer').getByRole('button', { name: '保存する', exact: true }).click();
await expect(page.locator('.editor-save-state')).toContainText('端末内保存済み');
const structured = await backup(page), structuredEdge = structured.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === edge.id);
if (!structuredEdge || structuredEdge.kind !== 'flow_edge') throw new Error('構造化画面で保存した条件がありません');
expect(structuredEdge.data.condition).toEqual({ op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'ge', value: { type: 'integer', value: 3 } });
const falseResult = evaluate(structured.project, structuredEdge.data.condition!);
expect(falseResult.value).toBe('false');
await reader(page, entry.id);
const choice = page.locator('.reader-choice').filter({ hasText: '共通規則で進む' });
await expect(choice).toBeDisabled();
await expect(choice).toContainText('条件を満たしていません');

// The same durable record/reference IDs are then edited through JSON.
const trueCondition: Condition = { ...structuredEdge.data.condition!, op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'ge', value: { type: 'integer', value: 2 } };
await openEntity(page, 'flow_edge', edge.name);
await editData(page, { ...structuredEdge.data, condition: trueCondition });
const json = await backup(page), jsonEdge = json.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === edge.id);
if (!jsonEdge || jsonEdge.kind !== 'flow_edge') throw new Error('JSON 画面で保存した条件がありません');
expect(jsonEdge.data.condition).toEqual(trueCondition);
const trueResult = evaluate(json.project, jsonEdge.data.condition!);
expect(trueResult.value).toBe('true');
await reader(page, entry.id);
await expect(choice).toBeEnabled();

// An unknown declared value remains unknown in both the oracle and UI.
await openEntity(page, 'variable', variable.name);
await editData(page, { ...variable.data, initial: { type: 'unknown', value: null, reason: 'AT-N16 未調査' } });
const unknown = await backup(page);
const unknownResult = evaluate(unknown.project, trueCondition);
expect(unknownResult).toEqual({ value: 'unknown', reasons: ['AT-N16 未調査'] });
await reader(page, entry.id);
await expect(choice).toBeDisabled();
await expect(choice).toContainText('未確認');
for (const reason of unknownResult.reasons) await expect(choice).toContainText(reason);
await openEntity(page, 'variable', variable.name);
await editData(page, variable.data);

// A valid AST with a mismatched typed comparison has the evaluator's code.

await openEntity(page, 'flow_edge', edge.name);
const details = page.locator('.detail-panel details.advanced-details').filter({ has: page.locator('summary').filter({ hasText: '詳細データ・ルビ・本文リンクを編集' }) });
await details.locator('summary').click();
const raw = details.getByRole('textbox', { name: '詳細データ', exact: true });
const beforeInvalid = await authorFingerprint(page);
const mismatch: Condition = { op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'eq', value: { type: 'boolean', value: true } };
const mismatchIssue = failure(json.project, mismatch);
await raw.fill(JSON.stringify({ ...jsonEdge.data, condition: mismatch }, null, 2));
const error = page.locator('.detail-panel [data-field="condition"]').getByRole('alert');
await expect(error.locator('code')).toHaveText(mismatchIssue.code);
await expect(error).toContainText('値の型が比較する状態と一致しません');
await expect(page.locator('.editor-footer').getByRole('button', { name: /保存する|保存を再試行/ })).toBeDisabled();
expect(await authorFingerprint(page)).toBe(beforeInvalid);
await raw.fill(JSON.stringify(jsonEdge.data, null, 2));
await page.locator('.editor-footer').getByRole('button', { name: /保存する|保存を再試行/ }).click();
await expect(page.locator('.editor-save-state')).toContainText('端末内保存済み');

const input: Record<string, TypedValue> = { [contract.id]: { type: 'integer', value: 1 } };
const externalIssue = failure(external.project, externalCondition, input);
await reader(page, entry.id);
await expect(choice).toContainText('未確認');
const beforeStub = await authorFingerprint(page);
const nativeStoredRecords = (JSON.parse(beforeStub)[1] as { projectId: string; record: { id: string; kind: string } }[])
  .filter(row => row.projectId === p.projectId).map(row => row.record);
// Native rich text is stored as block-ID markers, not hydrated Entity data.
expect(nativeStoredRecords.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual(baselineEntities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
await page.locator('.runtime-external .runtime-variable').filter({ hasText: contract.name }).getByRole('button', { name: '仮値', exact: true }).click();
const dialog = page.getByRole('dialog', { name: '作者の仮値を設定', exact: true });
await dialog.getByLabel('値の型', { exact: true }).selectOption('integer');
await dialog.getByLabel('値', { exact: true }).fill('1');
await dialog.getByRole('button', { name: '仮値を適用', exact: true }).click();
await expect(page.locator('.reader-issue code')).toHaveText(externalIssue.code);
await expect(page.locator('.reader-issue')).toContainText(externalIssue.message);
await expect(page.locator('.reader-trial-heading')).toContainText('確認が必要');

await openEntity(page, 'flow_edge', edge.name);
const details = page.locator('.detail-panel details.advanced-details').filter({ has: page.locator('summary').filter({ hasText: '詳細データ・ルビ・本文リンクを編集' }) });
await details.locator('summary').click();
const raw = details.getByRole('textbox', { name: '詳細データ', exact: true });
const beforeInvalid = await authorFingerprint(page);
const mismatch: Condition = { op: 'compare', variableId: variable.id, comparator: 'eq', value: { type: 'boolean', value: true } };
const mismatchIssue = failure(json.project, mismatch);
await raw.fill(JSON.stringify({ ...jsonEdge.data, condition: mismatch }, null, 2));
const error = page.locator('.detail-panel [data-field="condition"]').getByRole('alert');
await expect(error.locator('code')).toHaveText(mismatchIssue.code);
await expect(error).toContainText('値の型が比較する状態と一致しません');
await expect(page.locator('.editor-footer').getByRole('button', { name: /保存する|保存を再試行/ })).toBeDisabled();
expect(await authorFingerprint(page)).toBe(beforeInvalid);
await raw.fill(JSON.stringify(jsonEdge.data, null, 2));
await page.locator('.editor-footer').getByRole('button', { name: /保存する|保存を再試行/ }).click();
await expect(page.locator('.editor-save-state')).toContainText('端末内保存済み');

// Normal author saves of initial=unknown and its restoration create exactly
// two dependency reviews. They precede the stub and retain all six given IDs.
const givenIds = new Set(p.entities.map(entity => entity.id));
const retainedGiven = external.project.entities.filter(entity => givenIds.has(entity.id));
expect(retainedGiven.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual(p.entities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
const generatedReviews = external.project.entities.filter(entity => !givenIds.has(entity.id));
expect(generatedReviews).toHaveLength(2);
const transitions = generatedReviews.map(review => {
  if (review.kind !== 'review') throw new Error('通常保存が変更確認以外の情報を追加しました');
  const sourceRevisions = JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.sourceRevisions'])) as Record<string, string>;
  const next = sourceRevisions[variable.id];
  expect(['1', '2']).toContain(next);
  expect(review).toMatchObject({ projectId: p.projectId, status: 'needs_review', visibility: 'private',
    data: { target: edge.id, targetVersionId: p.projectId, stage: 'open', quotedText: null, resolution: [] },
    customValues: { 'changeReview.generatedBy': 'semantic-change-review/v1',
      'changeReview.projectRevision': next === '1' ? '3' : '4' } });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.sourceIds']))).toEqual([variable.id]);
  expect(sourceRevisions).toEqual({ [variable.id]: next });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.paths'])))
    .toEqual({ [variable.id]: { directPaths: ['data.condition.variableId'], relationLabels: [] } });
  expect(JSON.parse(String(review.customValues['changeReview.key'])))
    .toEqual({ targetId: edge.id, sources: [{ id: variable.id, revision: next,
      directPaths: ['data.condition.variableId'], relationLabels: [] }] });
  expect(review.data.body.map(block => block.text).join('\n'))
    .toContain(`(${variable.id})。改訂 ${next === '1' ? '0' : '1'} → ${next}。`);
  return next;
});
expect(transitions.sort()).toEqual(['1', '2']);
const baselineEntities = external.project.entities;
const baselineIds = baselineEntities.map(entity => entity.id).sort();
expect(baselineIds).toHaveLength(8);

const beforeStub = await authorFingerprint(page);
const nativeStoredRecords = (JSON.parse(beforeStub)[1] as { projectId: string; record: { id: string; kind: string } }[])
  .filter(row => row.projectId === p.projectId).map(row => row.record);
// Native rich text is stored as block-ID markers, not hydrated Entity data.
expect(nativeStoredRecords.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual(baselineEntities.map(({ id, kind }) => ({ id, kind })).sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
await page.locator('.runtime-external .runtime-variable').filter({ hasText: contract.name }).getByRole('button', { name: '仮値', exact: true }).click();
const dialog = page.getByRole('dialog', { name: '作者の仮値を設定', exact: true });
await dialog.getByLabel('値の型', { exact: true }).selectOption('integer');
await dialog.getByLabel('値', { exact: true }).fill('1');
await dialog.getByRole('button', { name: '仮値を適用', exact: true }).click();
await expect(page.locator('.reader-issue code')).toHaveText(externalIssue.code);
await expect(page.locator('.reader-issue')).toContainText(externalIssue.message);
await expect(page.locator('.reader-trial-heading')).toContainText('確認が必要');
expect(await authorFingerprint(page)).toBe(beforeStub);
await page.reload();
expect(await authorFingerprint(page)).toBe(beforeStub);
const cold = await backup(page);
// negative_or_edge: every display retains the same shared UUID references;
// trial input never creates replacement author IDs or commits runtime values.
expect(cold.project.entities.map(entity => entity.id).sort()).toEqual(baselineIds);
expect([...cold.project.entities].sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)))
  .toEqual([...baselineEntities].sort((a, b) => a.id.localeCompare(b.id)));
expect(cold.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === edge.id)?.data).toMatchObject({ condition: externalCondition });
expect(cold.project.entities.find(entity => entity.id === variable.id)?.data).toEqual(variable.data);

